ng with an injured hand.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":10,"text":"At the end of 10 laps Nuvolari at an average speed of 81.57 mph led from M\u00fcller by 14.6 seconds, Seaman by 15.8s, Lang by 22.0s and Brauchitsch by 30.0s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Raph retires with lost oil pressure; Maclure's Riley breaks a rear axle.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":16,"text":"At 16 laps Villoresi in the bright-red Alfa Romeo passed Brauchitsch to hold fifth place","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":18,"text":"A piston breaks in Villoresi's Maserati and he retires at the pits; Cuddon-Fletcher's MG goes off at Melbourne.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps Nuvolari with an average speed of 82.07 mph led from M\u00fcller by 21.8 seconds, Seaman by 22.6s in third place, Lang by 26.8s in fourth place","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"Dreyfus retired his Delahaye after 23 laps with a broken oil pump.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":26,"text":"Nuvolari's engine misfires; he pits for a plug (53s) and drops to fourth. M\u00fcller leads.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Hanson's Alta throws a rod and lays oil at Melbourne Hairpin; every German car spins on it.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":30,"text":"Hasse hits the safety bank and is out; Seaman stalls in the grass and loses a whole lap before officials push him back.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":30,"text":"M\u00fcller at an average speed of 80.10 mph now led from Lang by 4.0s, Nuvolari by 59.4s, Brauchitsch by 1m32.8s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":38,"text":"Lang was the first to do his refueling stop on lap 38 in 33 seconds and he did not lose second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":41,"text":"M\u00fcller stops for fuel and rear wheels (40s); Lang takes the lead.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":42,"text":"A stone smashes Lang's windscreen; he now drives with the cold air pounding his face.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":43,"text":"Nuvolari stopped on lap 43 to refuel and change four wheels in 35 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":43,"text":"B\u00e4umer's Mercedes reaches the pits on fire from a faulty exhaust gasket and is retired.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":53,"text":"Nuvolari was now really trying and at 53 laps he passed M\u00fcller.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"Lang led at 80.01 mph average speed from Nuvolari by 21 seconds","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":63,"text":"Nuvolari laps at 83.71 mph and cuts the gap to Lang to 12 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":64,"text":"M\u00fcller pits with overheating; a broken cooling-flap linkage is repaired in 38 seconds.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":67,"text":"Nuvolari gained a few seconds every lap and on lap 67 he passed Lang on Starkey Straight at a speed of 160 mph.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":69,"text":"At 69 laps Seaman caught M\u00fcller, passed him, gaining third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":80,"text":"At the end of lap 80, Nuvolari crossed the finish line with the Auto Union after 3h06m22.0s at 80.49 mph average speed","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"Lang finished second on the same lap. When he got out of his car he fell flat down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1}]}